codex
Bao cao Phase 2 da duoc ghi vao [smart-slider-3-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/smart-slider-3-phase2.codex.json).

Ket luan: `0` TP, `0` REVIEW, `3` FP. Ca 3 anomaly tu Phase 1 trong [OutputBuffer.php](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/plugins/smart-slider-3/Nextend/WordPress/OutputBuffer.php#L134) deu bi refute vi `is_admin()` o day chi dung de bat/tat frontend output buffering cho compatibility, khong gate quyen hay mo sink nhay cam. Toi cung trace them cac surface gia tri cao va ghi vao `negative_findings`/`out_of_scope`: helper AJAX nonce-gated khong tao impact security thuc te, loose compare trong [WordPressFrontend.php](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/plugins/smart-slider-3/Nextend/SmartSlider3/Platform/WordPress/WordPressFrontend.php#L37) khong thanh auth bypass practical, va deserialization trong import flow la admin-only/out of Patchstack scope.

Kiem tra cuoi: JSON hop le qua `jq`. Psalm artifact trong [smart-slider-3-psalm.sarif](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase1/smart-slider-3-psalm.sarif) chi chua `{"status":"error","exit_code":1}`, nen khong dung duoc de corroborate.
